~ topic #[死了 "si3 le"]

structure subject + pejorative adj. + $topic

main-trl so, terribly, to death

examples

example #1[热 re4] / #2[冷 leng3] $topic！
trl The weather is so *1[hot] / *2[cold]!

example #1[我饿 "wo3 e4"] #2[$topic]。
trl *2[I'm] *1[so] *2[hungry].

example #[吵 chao3] $topic！
trl What a ruckus!

end examples

p $topic is a degree complement. A degree complement usually follows an adjective which it intensifies or modifies.